{
  "$comment": "Crystal surfaces: every lab palette colour binds to ONE surface (first matching rule wins). The palette colour stays the art direction (vertex colour); the surface adds the physical truth (roughness, metalness, micro relief, grunge) from the material library. `library` points at a catalogue id from scripts/crystal/library/catalog.json (null = built-in procedural fallback). Edit with the crystal skill (look-dev in Blender via MCP), then rebuild.",
  "version": 1,
  "surfaces": {
